
NOTE ON CATALOG WORK FOR ADDING A NEW TYPE:
Detail information: http://www.postgresql.org/docs/8.2/static/extend.html
 
Find unused oid using ./cdb-pg/src/include/catalog/unused_oid for catalog entires

1. Define new type and its supported functions:
	Add sql definition for type in pg_type.sql
	Add sql definition for function in pg_proc.sql (README.add_new_function)
	Open pg_type.h & pg_proc.h for edit
	Run catullus.pl to convert those sql def to into internal def
	
2. Define operators supported for this new type:
	Add underlying function to do the real work for these operators
	Add operators into pg_operator.h
 
3. Define operator class to support indexing of this new data type:
	Add index access method for this new type to pg_opclass.h:
		B-tree, Hash and other opclasses.
		Although we don't support hash index, hash opclass is needed for hash join.
	Add index method strategies (operators associated with operator class) to pg_amop.h
		B-tree strategies are in sorting order from lesser to greater
	Add index method support routines to pg_amproc.h
		B-tree index method must be able to compare 2 keys
	Opclass is also used for join:
		B-tree opclass is used for sort merge joina (GUC: enable_mergejoin)
		Hash opclass is used for hash join (GUC: enable_hashjoin - GPDB default join)
		Nested loop join does not require an opclass. (GUC: enable_nestloop)

4. Define cast for this new data type:
	Add functions to support the cast
	Add cast entries to pg_cast.h

5. GPDB specific:
	Update tidycat JSON file:
		p4 edit gpMgmt/bin/gppylib/data/<version>.json
		make gen_json_cat

	Fix installcheck upgrade tests:
		Add type and function stmts to:
			cdb-pg/src/test/regress/data/upgrade_GPDBVERSION/upg2_catupgrade_paris.sql.in
		Add operator, opclass, amop, amproc and cast to:
			cdb-pg/src/test/regress/data/upgrade_GPDBVERSION/pg_operator.data
			cdb-pg/src/test/regress/data/upgrade_GPDBVERSION/pg_opclass.data
			cdb-pg/src/test/regress/data/upgrade_GPDBVERSION/pg_amop.data
			cdb-pg/src/test/regress/data/upgrade_GPDBVERSION/pg_amproc.data
			cdb-pg/src/test/regress/data/upgrade_GPDBVERSION/pg_cast.data
		fix up: cdb-pg/test/regress/output/upgrade.source
